Test Case 1

Test Case ID: TC_payment_001

Test Desc:
Verify that the user can purchase a product using Credit Card.

Test Steps:

Open Flipkart website.
Search for a product.
Select the product.
Click Buy Now.
Proceed to the payment page.
Select Credit Card.
Enter valid card details.
Complete the payment.
Expected Result:
User should be able to successfully purchase the product using Credit Card.

